[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    19[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   anything `>15`, anything `<0`, and the two `int` extremes.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    20[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * `psamp`: `int[8]` ring buffer, indexed `(idx - k) & 7` for `k` in `1..=8`.
